-- The table grants of the production database, as of 3 Oct 2026 (generated from information_schema.role_table_grants).
--
-- The hosted Supabase platform gave every table to the API roles by default privileges, and the migrations never GRANT by
-- themselves; a database created today by the CLI does not do that, so the behaviour checks fail there with "permission denied for
-- table ...". CI applies this file right after replaying the migrations so that the checks run against the grants production has,
-- including the tables the migrations deliberately lock down (they are simply absent from this list for the roles concerned).
--
-- A NEW SUPABASE PROJECT (or the Aurora move) needs the same: turn this list into a real migration before relying on a database that
-- was not created on the old platform.
